The Good:

Altars have been plentiful, and I got Stormbringer from what was just
about my first sacrifice at one.  Enchanted it up to +6.  Later, blessed
a stack of 11 potions of water at another altar.  None of the altars
have been attended except for the (cross-aligned) one in Minetown.

Found early boots of speed and jumping.

After accumulating a lot of unidentified stuff with no way to price-ID,
I read a blessed scroll that turned out to be identify, and got a
full-inventory ID.

Enchanted a stack of 11 blessed daggers up to +3, and have been fairly
deadly with them.  Shopkeepers fall to 2-3 expert dagger barrages.

Am permanently invisible (potion plus stalker corpse).

Have reflection from the amulet in Sokoban.


The Bad:

Only three stores have been generated in the entire game: two tiny ones
in Minetown (Izchak's and a deli) and a medium-sized armor store that
didn't have anything better than the mithril suit I'd already found.

Only found two rings so far, fire resistance and polymorph control.

I've only encountered one floating eye in the entire game, and it didn't
leave a corpse, so no telepathy.

Aside from the boots, have found no other interesting armor AT ALL.  I'm
currently sporting +0 old gloves, a +0 hooded cloak, and a rusty +0
crested helmet.  (I didn't have any gloves at all for the longest time,
leading me to be ver-r-r-ry careful around cockatrices.)  A polymorph
trap in the Mines made short work of my starting cloak of displacement.

No special rooms have been generated other than a leprechaun hall and a
couple of swamps.


So I've just cleared out the Castle and gotten my long-wished-for GDSM
and bag of holding from the wand there.  I'm a titan, having polymorphed
into that form (via wand) in order to cross the moat after a soldier
blasted the drawbridge to flinders with a wand of striking.  There were
two disenchanters among the courtyard monsters, leading to a LOT of
careful pussyfooting around so I only attacked them with my +0 dagger.
What a pain.  Also, a xorn ate five of my +3 daggers that I hurled
across the drawbridge before I realized what was happening.  Oops!

So, any suggestions on what should I be doing now?  I'm level 12 (I
think; I still haven't reverted from titan form, and the status line
just says "HD: 16" instead of my level).  I've ascended back up to
Medusa's level and have just picked up a potion of gain level from a
death drop; don't know its BUC status yet.  My AC was, I believe, a
measly -2 or -3 prior to my transformation.  (I scored a few points of
protection from the Minetown priest.)  I do have a magic marker, but I
don't know how many charges it has left; I wrote a few enchant weapon
